releaseNotes:
v2.9 - Updating package versions; Adding new "quick" command alias to add a repo as a quick sync repo;
v2.8 - Adding better error handling for command timeouts on large repos;
v2.7 - Updating nuget packages and adjusting how the tool calls git to work better in parallel mode;
v2.6 - Adding 'status' command to show status across multiple repos; Adding .net 10 support;
v2.5 - Package updates & minor bug fixes
